        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>36. A Hard Trip</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  html,\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  body {\n    color: #111;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n  }\n\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 540px;\n    height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    background: #fff;\n  }\n\n  .running-header {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 35px;\n    left: 68px;\n    width: 415px;\n    text-align: center;\n    color: #555;\n    font-family: SimSun, \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    font-size: 7px;\n    line-height: 9px;\n  }\n\n  .header-rule {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 45px;\n    left: 68px;\n    width: 415px;\n    height: 1px;\n    background: #555;\n  }\n\n  .chapter-title {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 55px;\n    left: 69px;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    line-height: 14px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .chinese-title {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 82px;\n    left: 90px;\n    margin: 0;\n    font-family: SimSun, \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    font-size: 11.5px;\n    line-height: 14px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .text-block {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 69px;\n    width: 415px;\n  }\n\n  .english {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 10.8px;\n    line-height: 27.4px;\n  }\n\n  .english .line,\n  .chinese .line {\n    height: 27.4px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .english .first-line {\n    padding-left: 36px;\n  }\n\n  .english strong {\n    font-weight: 700;\n  }\n\n  .chinese {\n    font-family: SimSun, \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    font-size: 10.8px;\n    line-height: 27.2px;\n  }\n\n  .block-one {\n    top: 105px;\n  }\n\n  .block-two {\n    top: 298px;\n  }\n\n  .block-three {\n    top: 433px;\n  }\n\n  .block-four {\n    top: 598px;\n  }\n\n  .watermark {\n    position: absolute;\n    z-index: 3;\n    top: 351px;\n    left: 217px;\n    width: 92px;\n    color: rgba(110, 110, 110, 0.22);\n    font-family: SimSun, \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    font-size: 25px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n    text-align: center;\n    transform: rotate(-34deg);\n    pointer-events: none;\n  }\n\n  .footer {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 683px;\n    left: 0;\n    width: 540px;\n    color: #666;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: SimSun, \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    font-size: 7.5px;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"running-header\">英语3500必考词——精析</div>\n  <div class=\"header-rule\"></div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"chapter-title\">36. A Hard Trip</h1>\n  <h2 class=\"chinese-title\">一次辛苦的旅行</h2>\n\n  <section class=\"text-block english block-one\">\n    <div class=\"line first-line\">My sister <strong>was fond of</strong> traveling. <strong>Ever since graduating,</strong> she had been</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><strong>determined to organize</strong> a trip to an old <strong>temple.</strong> Since <strong>transporting fare</strong> was expensive,</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">she decided to use a bicycle to <strong>cycle</strong> there not <strong>caring about the disadvantages.</strong> Her</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><strong>stubborn attitude</strong> was always her <strong>shortcoming.</strong> Once she <strong>made up her mind</strong> to do</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">something, no one could <strong>persuade</strong> her to change her <strong>mind. Finally, we gave in as</strong></div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><strong>usual</strong> though we <strong>preferred</strong> to take a train. After we prepared everything, including the</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><strong>schedule, reliable</strong> weather <strong>forecast</strong> and the <strong>insurance,</strong> we began our trip.</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"text-block chinese block-two\">\n    <div class=\"line\">　　我的妹妹很喜欢旅行。自从毕业以来，她就下定决心要组织一次往一座古庙的旅行。</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">因为交通费用昂贵，她决定骑自行车去，毫不担心其中的不利情况。顽固的态度一直都是</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">她的缺点，一旦她下定决心要做的事，就没有人能说服她改变主意。最后，我们像往常一</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">样让步，尽管我们更喜欢乘火车去。我们准备好了所有东西，包括时间表、可靠的天气预</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">报，还有保险，就开始了旅程。</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"watermark\">样书</div>\n\n  <section class=\"text-block english block-three\">\n    <div class=\"line first-line\">Our <strong>journey</strong> was along a river <strong>flowing</strong> from a high <strong>altitude.</strong> Our <strong>pace</strong> was slow</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">because the river frequently had many sharp <strong>bends</strong> through deep <strong>valleys,</strong> where the</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">water seemed to <strong>boil.</strong> Just as I recorded in my <strong>journal,</strong> it was really a hard journey.</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">But we also enjoyed great <strong>views.</strong> One night, I put my head on my <strong>pillow—a parcel of</strong></div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><strong>wool</strong> coats, and lay beneath the stars. When the <strong>flame</strong> in front of our <strong>cave</strong> went out</div>\n    <div class=\"line\"><strong>at midnight,</strong> I found the sky so beautiful!</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"text-block chinese block-four\">\n    <div class=\"line\">　　我们的旅程沿着一条从高海拔处流下来的河流前行。但我们的步伐很慢，因为当流经</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">深深的峡谷时，这条河流急转弯很多，急湍的河水都似乎沸腾起来。正如我在旅行日志里</div>\n    <div class=\"line\">记录的那样，这真是一次艰苦的旅行。但是我们也欣赏到了美丽的景色。一天晚上，我把</div>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"footer\">第 18 页 共 23 页</div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
